<p>Hi <%= @request.name %>,</p>
<p>You're in the RecoveryBot <strong><%= @request.platform_name %></strong> app test. Thanks for helping.</p>
<% if @android %>
  <p>On your Android phone, signed in with <strong><%= @request.email %></strong>:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the link below.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Become a tester</strong>.</li>
    <li>Tap the <strong>download it on Google Play</strong> link and install RecoveryBot.</li>
  </ol>
  <p><a href="<%= @url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; background: #0b6ede; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Join the test on Google Play</a></p>
<% else %>
  <p>On your iPhone:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the link below.</li>
    <li>Install Apple's free TestFlight app if it asks.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Accept</strong>, then <strong>Install</strong>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p><a href="<%= @url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; background: #0b6ede; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Join the beta on TestFlight</a></p>
<% end %>
<p style="color: #57534e; font-size: 14px;">Found a bug or have an idea? Reply to this email or use the Contact page in the app.</p>
